	\end{equation}
	Otherwise, $\tau(e_n) - \beta \geq 0$.  Since $\gamma \leq \frac14$ (by \eqref{eq:new-8} and \eqref{eq:new-4} since we assume $\epsilon < 1$), we then have
	\begin{equation}\label{eq:new-22}
